  "aiContextParagraph": "A leadership crisis is unfolding at The Fountain of Life Church in Ilupeju, Lagos, involving Pastor Jimmy Odukoya and his sister, Tolu. The dispute reached a critical point after a court reportedly issued an order restraining Jimmy Odukoya from holding his position as senior pastor and spiritual leader. While reports of the legal action have circulated, Odukoya maintains that he has not been officially served with the court documents. Amid the mounting tensions, significant police presence has been observed at the church premises, and attendees faced enhanced security checks during recent services. Other religious leaders, including Bishop Mike Okonkwo, have intervened by urging members of the congregation to avoid partisanship as the internal succession conflict continues to escalate and draw public attention to the church's administrative operations.",
